   "description": "No proposal directory yet; Go reports an empty proposal set and exits 0. Filesystem comparison is off for this stage: Go's sidecar open also writes vaults/<hash>/metadata.json and keeps the WAL/SHM files, which the Rust index layer does not port yet (also visible for `ls`); the case therefore pins stdout, stderr and the exit code."
  },
